          "docs": "This endpoint can be used to create an event set that can later be paginated through with a cursor. The set will be persisted and available for pagination for approximately 24 hours.\n\nWhen creating the event set the events may not be immediately available. Check the `status` property to determine if the events are available.\n- If `in_progress`, periodically check `GET /event_sets/{id}` until status is `finished`.\n- If `finished`, `events` will contain the events, and `cursor` will contain the cu"
